    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d633">

                <pb facs="0882" n="768" sameAs="frus:frus1931v01/pg768"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/1463a: Circular telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Certain Diplomatic Representatives in Latin
                        America</hi><anchor n="2" xml:id="d633-f1"/></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-10-19T17:00:00-05:00">October 19, 1931—5
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>All countries having agreed to sign joint telegram to Bolivia and Paraguay, it
                    was signed by the 19 other American countries at 12:30 today and sent forward
                    immediately.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d633-f1" n="2" type="source" xml:id="d633-f1-content">
                <p>The diplomatic representatives in all Latin American republics except Bolivia and
                    Paraguay.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
